which proves the first formula of (B1). Differentiate `D2` twice. The terms
containing `b3*C'(0)` cancel by `D3`, leaving

\[
 \frac y2Y''(0)=gU''(0)+C_0T_0.
 \tag{B5}
\]

Now `D1'(0)=0` reads

\[
